Noto Sans SC (Simplified Chinese)

This directory contains NotoSansSC-Regular.ttf (Chinese-simplified weight 400)
from the Fontsource packaging of Google Noto Sans SC.

License: SIL Open Font License 1.1
https://scripts.sil.org/OFL

Upstream: https://github.com/google/fonts (ofl/notosanssc)
Fontsource: https://fontsource.org/fonts/noto-sans-sc
